      "writtenOn": "2026-01-28T08:20:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t it possible to miss the event this way? E.g. if a tool waits for the response_ready IRQ_type here, and the host command handler triggers the event, before host command response is ready.",
      "revId": "f3049937ce0f7f592c5ed37aa57fc6e1625c29e3",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
